␀␀obj_canister2destroyed␀Canister 2 Destroyed␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀loading1␀That the head of Talon International is a former SEAL has come as a shock to us all.

LONESTAR's past is checkered at best, but what interests me is that the KRA are storing a shipment of chemical weapons at an old Soviet base.

If we can get to those weapons and destroy them, we will have accomplished our mission.␀␀␀␀␀␀loading2␀SANDMAN doesn't like the fact that we're putting our faith in intel from a discharged SEAL, but we have to trust that LONESTAR still carries the loyalty and honour of the badge he once held.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀desc_chopper␀[sound of chopper flying overhead]␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀lookoutNIS_0␀Lookout Point NIS␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀lookoutNIS_1␀The SEALs reach a lookout point where a gun emplacement can be seen in the distance.␀␀␀␀␀␀lookoutNIS_2␀They discuss whether to engage the enemy from their current position, or to attempt to make their way forward undetected.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀pillboxNIS_0␀Pillbox NIS␀␀␀␀␀␀␀pillboxNIS_1␀The SEALs sneak up behind the guard and stealth-kill him. Then they recon the training yard, and observe a bunker access to the vehicle yard.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀abductionNIS_0␀Abduction NIS␀␀␀␀␀␀␀abductionNIS_1␀The SEALs are ambushed on their way to the extraction area, and one of their members is abducted.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀abudctionNIS_2␀[Mission Complete]␀␀␀␀␀␀
